
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Join Impact International Youth. Explore opportunities to contribute to our team, develop your skills and create impact.">
  <title>Work With Us | Impact International Youth</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="assets/logo.png">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">

  <style>
    .wu-page {
      --wu-green: #1f4d3a;
      --wu-green-light: #3f6b4f;
      --wu-beige: #f5efe3;
      --wu-cream: #fffaf0;
      --wu-text: #263b30;
      --wu-muted: #68776b;
      color: var(--wu-text);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .wu-container {
      width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: auto;
    }

    .wu-hero {
      background: var(--wu-green);
      color: var(--wu-cream);
      padding: 100px 20px 90px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .wu-hero::before,
    .wu-hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      border-radius: 50%;
      width: 380px;
      height: 380px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .wu-hero::before {
      top: -240px;
      left: -100px;
    }

    .wu-hero::after {
      bottom: -270px;
      right: -100px;
      width: 480px;
      height: 480px;
    }

    .wu-eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      color: #d8e5d6;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 2.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .wu-hero h1 {
      color: var(--wu-cream);
      font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 68px);
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: -2px;
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 0 auto 22px;
    }

    .wu-hero p {
      color: #e0e9df;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto 32px;
    }

    .wu-button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 14px 25px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      background: var(--wu-beige);
      color: var(--wu-green);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      transition: .2s ease;
    }

    .wu-button:hover {
      background: white;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .wu-button-outline {
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.5);
      color: white;
    }

    .wu-button-outline:hover {
      color: var(--wu-green);
    }

    .wu-intro {
      background: var(--wu-beige);
      padding: 85px 20px;
    }

    .wu-section-heading {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin-bottom: 42px;
    }

    .wu-section-heading span {
      color: var(--wu-green-light);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .wu-section-heading h2 {
      color: var(--wu-green);
      font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 43px);
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      margin: 12px 0;
    }

    .wu-section-heading p {
      color: var(--wu-muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .wu-opportunities {
      background: var(--wu-cream);
      padding: 85px 20px;
    }

    .wu-opportunity-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .wu-card {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #e9e5db;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 30px;
      transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
    }

    .wu-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(31,77,58,.08);
    }

    .wu-card-number {
      color: #9aa995;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .wu-card-icon {
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: var(--wu-beige);
      color: var(--wu-green);
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 21px;
      margin: 22px 0 18px;
    }

    .wu-card h3 {
      color: var(--wu-green);
      font-size: 21px;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }

    .wu-card p {
      color: var(--wu-muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .wu-benefits {
      background: var(--wu-beige);
      padding: 85px 20px;
    }

    .wu-benefit-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .wu-benefit {
      padding: 22px 18px;
      border-left: 2px solid var(--wu-green-light);
    }

    .wu-benefit h3 {
      color: var(--wu-green);
      font-size: 17px;
      margin: 0 0 10px;
    }

    .wu-benefit p {
      color: var(--wu-muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .wu-expectations {
      background: var(--wu-cream);
      padding: 85px 20px;
    }

    .wu-expectations-box {
      background: var(--wu-green);
      color: white;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 35px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .wu-expectations-box h2 {
      color: var(--wu-cream);
      font-size: 28px;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }

    .wu-expectations-box p {
      color: #dce7dc;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .wu-expectations-box ul {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 20px;
      color: #e5ede3;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 2.1;
    }

    .wu-cta {
      background: var(--wu-beige);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 90px 20px;
    }

    .wu-cta h2 {
      color: var(--wu-green);
      font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      margin: 0 0 15px;
    }

    .wu-cta p {
      color: var(--wu-muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
      max-width: 570px;
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
    }

    .wu-cta .wu-button {
      background: var(--wu-green);
      color: white;
    }

    .wu-cta .wu-button:hover {
      background: var(--wu-green-light);
    }

    .wu-page a:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid #b7cbb3;
      outline-offset: 4px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .wu-benefit-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .wu-hero {
        padding: 75px 20px;
      }

      .wu-hero h1 {
        letter-spacing: -1px;
      }

      .wu-opportunity-grid,
      .wu-expectations-box {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .wu-card {
        padding: 25px;
      }

      .wu-intro,
      .wu-opportunities,
      .wu-benefits,
      .wu-expectations {
        padding: 65px 20px;
      }

      .wu-benefit-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 22px 10px;
      }

      .wu-expectations-box {
        padding: 27px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .wu-card,
      .wu-button {
        transition: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="wu-page">

    <section class="wu-hero">
      <div class="wu-container">
        <span class="wu-eyebrow">Impact International Youth · Recruitment</span>
        <h1>Be part of something that creates impact.</h1>
        <p>
          We're growing, and we're looking for passionate, creative and
          dedicated young individuals to join our international team.
          Bring your ideas, develop your skills and help us make a difference.
        </p>
        <a href="join.html" class="wu-button">Explore opportunities &nbsp; →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wu-intro">
      <div class="wu-container">
        <div class="wu-section-heading">
          <span>Work with us</span>
          <h2>Your contribution can make a difference.</h2>
          <p>
            Impact International Youth brings young people together through
            education, dialogue, diplomacy and community initiatives.
            Our team makes these opportunities possible.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wu-opportunities" id="opportunities">
      <div class="wu-container">
        <div class="wu-section-heading">
          <span>Explore the team</span>
          <h2>Where would you like to contribute?</h2>
          <p>
            We have opportunities across several areas of the organisation.
            Find an area that matches your interests and strengths.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="wu-opportunity-grid">

          <article class="wu-card">
            <span class="wu-card-number">01 / COMMUNICATION</span>
            <div class="wu-card-icon">✦</div>
            <h3>Media & Communications</h3>
            <p>
              Help communicate IIY's work, create engaging content,
              support social media activities and share our initiatives
              with a wider audience.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="wu-card">
            <span class="wu-card-number">02 / PARTNERSHIPS</span>
            <div class="wu-card-icon">↗</div>
            <h3>Partnerships & External Relations</h3>
            <p>
              Support outreach, build relationships with organisations
              and explore opportunities for collaboration and partnerships.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="wu-card">
            <span class="wu-card-number">03 / COMMUNITY</span>
            <div class="wu-card-icon">◎</div>
            <h3>Youth Engagement</h3>
            <p>
              Help connect young people, encourage participation,
              support community activities and make our initiatives
              more accessible.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="wu-card">
            <span class="wu-card-number">04 / DEVELOPMENT</span>
            <div class="wu-card-icon">⌘</div>
            <h3>Research & Development</h3>
            <p>
              Contribute ideas, explore new topics, support research
              and help develop future projects and initiatives.
            </p>
          </article>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wu-benefits">
      <div class="wu-container">
        <div class="wu-section-heading">
          <span>What you gain</span>
          <h2>Grow while making an impact.</h2>
          <p>
            Being part of IIY is an opportunity to learn through real
            responsibilities, teamwork and international collaboration.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="wu-benefit-grid">
          <div class="wu-benefit">
            <h3>Recognition</h3>
            <p>Official certificates recognising your contributions and service.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wu-benefit">
            <h3>Experience</h3>
            <p>Practical experience in teamwork, leadership and organisation.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wu-benefit">
            <h3>Connections</h3>
            <p>Opportunities to collaborate with young people internationally.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wu-benefit">
            <h3>Development</h3>
            <p>Build confidence, communication skills and new perspectives.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wu-expectations">
      <div class="wu-container">
        <div class="wu-expectations-box">
          <div>
            <h2>A commitment to making a difference.</h2>
            <p>
              IIY is a youth-led organisation built through the time,
              effort and ideas of its members. We value people who are
              responsible, collaborative and willing to contribute.
            </p>
          </div>

          <ul>
            <li>All team positions are voluntary and unpaid.</li>
            <li>Members are expected to contribute their time and skills.</li>
            <li>Professional conduct and teamwork are important.</li>
            <li>Members must respect organisational confidentiality.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wu-cta">
      <div class="wu-container">
        <span class="wu-eyebrow" style="color:#3f6b4f">Your next step starts here</span>
        <h2>Ready to join the team?</h2>
        <p>
          If you're ready to contribute, learn and grow with us,
          we'd love to hear from you.
        </p>
        <a href="join.html" class="wu-button">Apply to join IIY &nbsp; →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>

  <script src="js/script.js"></script>

</body>
</html>
